cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or its measurements, please cite the paper it
  reproduces, listed under preferred-citation.
type: software
title: Medical Imaging Lakehouse Compaction Reference Implementation
abstract: >-
  Reproduction package for the paper "Compaction as a Storage Layout Decision
  for 3D Medical Imaging in Network-Constrained Hybrid Clouds". It builds four
  storage layouts of the LIDC-IDRI chest CT collection as Apache Iceberg
  tables, measures three workloads across fifteen bandwidth and round-trip-time
  configurations, and redraws every table and figure of the paper from the
  committed measurement campaign.
authors:
